# Runtime state generated by running the CLI/UI — not source, and the
# CLI's own state file can include repository/audit details tied to a
# specific run. A fresh clone starts with neither and the tools recreate
# them (see each project's own state-file docs below).
release-manager-v2/.release-manager.json
release-manager-v2/.release-manager.json.*.tmp
release-manager-v2/.release-manager.json.publication.lock
release-manager-review-ui/audit-log.jsonl

node_modules/
